{"projectInfo":{"name":"DS-Lite B4端口块动态映射配置","path":"dslite1","visibility":2,"categoryId":31,"introduction":"B4设备为用户网络的网关或者运行DS-Lite客户端软件的用户主机，AFTR设备作为隧道端点设备和NAT网关负责执行隧道报文的封装、解封装以及对解封装后的IPv4地址进行转换。通过在B4和AFTR之间建立DS-Lite隧道，并在AFTR连接IPv4 network接口上配置NAT，为DS-Lite host动态分配端口块，实现IPv4私网穿越IPv6网络访问IPv4公网。","label":["DS-Lite"]},"deviceInfoList":[{"resourceName":"B4","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\B4.cfg"},{"resourceName":"IPv4-Host-A","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\IPv4-Host-A.cfg"},{"resourceName":"IPv4-Host-B","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\IPv4-Host-B.cfg"},{"resourceName":"AFTR","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\AFTR.cfg"}]}